{
  "name": "08 · FAQ Bot (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Support)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 08 · FAQ Bot\nFees kitni? ITR ke liye kya documents? Last date kab hai? WhatsApp pe turant jawab, sirf aapki FAQ sheet se. Notice / penalty / tax calculation → owner ko alert.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID).\n2. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **FAQ** with columns Question, Answer.\n3. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n4. Replace YOUR_OFFICE_WHATSAPP (country code, no +).",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3667ed33-9b00-4717-8325-59f05805b258",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4eb55b5c-4552-4368-8981-0cb6d94988ae",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Client {{ $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '' }} asks: {{ $json.messages?.[0]?.text?.body }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the WhatsApp front desk of YOUR FIRM NAME, a small business. Answer ONLY from the 'Firm FAQ' sheet tool (fees per service, office timings, address, documents needed for ITR / GST registration / GST return, standard due dates, payment modes). Reply in the client's language (Hinglish/Hindi/English), max 3 short lines, warm and professional. Greet with 'Hello <name> ji', never 'Namaste'. If the answer is not in the sheet, set handoff=true and say our team will call back. Never give tax or legal advice beyond the firm's FAQ sheet, never promise refunds or outcomes, never quote a client's financial data to anyone else. Anything about notices, penalties, scrutiny or a specific tax calculation goes to the owner (handoff).\nOutput ONLY JSON: {\"reply\": \"...\", \"handoff\": false, \"topic\": \"fees|deadline|documents|timing|other\"}"
        }
      },
      "id": "0051e082-61dd-42a9-9359-c36f14661160",
      "name": "AI answers FAQ",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
